WEBVTT

1
00:57:50.122 --> 00:57:56.122
Are there any guests today in Open Church? Raise your hand if you are here for the first time.

2
00:57:56.122 --> 00:58:03.122
Willem, you are not here for the first time, but I want to give a round of applause for our dear Willem, because I think it's wonderful that you are here.

3
00:58:05.122 --> 00:58:11.122
Willem lives in Luxembourg, but he is simply part of Open Church. Amen.

4
00:58:11.122 --> 00:58:21.122
Any other people guests in Open Church here for the first time? Raise your hand. No one else? Then we need to try harder.

5
00:58:23.122 --> 00:58:30.122
Is anyone happy in the Lord? Wonderful, wonderful. We are too.

6
00:58:30.122 --> 00:58:42.122
And I am very excited about this segment of the service. I was super excited to glorify Jesus during our Songs for Him.

7
00:58:42.122 --> 00:58:50.122
What is about to come is also great. We said last week that we would give an update on the construction project.

8
00:58:50.122 --> 00:58:59.122
Do you all remember that? As I look around the room and see all those extra chairs, I also see the need for a new construction project.

9
00:58:59.122 --> 00:59:04.122
Does anyone agree with me? We simply need a new building.

10
00:59:04.122 --> 00:59:12.122
And it's not just luxury talk, but it is also urgency in Christ that we are going to build a new building.

11
00:59:12.122 --> 00:59:21.122
Vanessa wisely said last week, because we also need to pray and think not about how cool it is to build a new building.

12
00:59:21.122 --> 00:59:27.122
It's not just about the splendor of the walls and how beautifully the architect has designed such a building.

13
00:59:27.122 --> 00:59:33.122
It's about functionality. What are we doing in Open Church that makes God happy?

14
00:59:33.122 --> 00:59:42.122
That is what it is really about. The walls are just walls. The walls are merely an industrial hall that we are going to build.

15
00:59:42.122 --> 00:59:47.122
It doesn't amount to much. But it is about functionality.

16
00:59:47.122 --> 00:59:53.122
What are we doing in Open Church that pleases God the Father in heaven, makes Him happy?

17
00:59:53.122 --> 00:59:59.122
What makes Him happy? It makes Him happy when we glorify Him with our words.

18
00:59:59.122 --> 01:00:02.122
It makes Him happy when we come together in the name of Jesus.

19
01:00:02.122 --> 01:00:07.122
It makes Him happy when we preach the Word as it is in the Bible.

20
01:00:07.122 --> 01:00:10.122
It makes Him happy when we baptize people in the name of Jesus.

21
01:00:10.122 --> 01:00:14.122
It makes Him happy when we come before the Lord in obedience.

22
01:00:14.122 --> 01:00:22.122
It makes Him happy when young people do not live like the world, but set themselves apart in holiness to live for the kingdom of God.

23
01:00:22.122 --> 01:00:25.122
And the list goes on and on and on.

24
01:00:25.122 --> 01:00:29.122
That makes God the Father happy and that is our mission Open Church. Amen.

25
01:00:29.122 --> 01:00:35.122
We will continue to work until Jesus Christ returns.

26
01:00:35.122 --> 01:00:39.122
For Open Church will exist at the moment He returns.

27
01:00:39.122 --> 01:00:44.122
Do you hear what I am saying? This church will not die before His return.

28
01:00:44.122 --> 01:00:47.122
Ah ah. Not gonna happen.

29
01:00:48.122 --> 01:00:49.122
Praise the Lord.

30
01:00:49.122 --> 01:00:53.122
So today we are going to give an update on the construction.

31
01:00:53.122 --> 01:01:08.122
The last update we gave you was a moment, last summer, when we told you that we could not get a loan from any bank.

32
01:01:08.122 --> 01:01:11.122
Do you remember that? You remember that, right?

33
01:01:11.122 --> 01:01:13.122
And that was such an amen moment.

34
01:01:14.122 --> 01:01:17.122
We are not getting loans from the banks.

35
01:01:19.122 --> 01:01:22.122
But this is amen and this is glorious.

36
01:01:22.122 --> 01:01:27.122
I will take you back once more to the beginning of the whole construction project.

37
01:01:27.122 --> 01:01:28.122
How everything came about.

38
01:01:28.122 --> 01:01:34.122
Some people have come to Open Church this year and are thinking to themselves, okay what are we talking about.

39
01:01:34.122 --> 01:01:38.122
We are going to build a new building. It is necessary.

40
01:01:38.122 --> 01:01:44.122
The Lord has blessed us, I believe in 2002, with this building on the Saskesdreef, the old building.

41
01:01:44.122 --> 01:01:47.122
And we have been so incredibly blessed from day one.

42
01:01:47.122 --> 01:01:52.122
Oh, oh, oh dear people. God blesses and God guides.

43
01:01:52.122 --> 01:01:55.122
He is such a good guide of life.

44
01:01:55.122 --> 01:02:01.122
And when we were offered this building in 2002, this building did not exist yet, did it?

45
01:02:01.122 --> 01:02:03.122
This was not here. It was just that old building.

46
01:02:03.122 --> 01:02:10.122
And we were there in the old building and we were so grateful for what God gave us.

47
01:02:10.122 --> 01:02:17.122
And eventually the church grew and the church kept growing and eventually we were there in that small room.

48
01:02:17.122 --> 01:02:20.122
And we call it the small room because that small room is small.

49
01:02:20.122 --> 01:02:22.122
And at a certain point we grew out of it.

50
01:02:22.122 --> 01:02:25.122
And in 2014 we built this hall.

51
01:02:25.122 --> 01:02:28.122
And we were so incredibly happy with it.

52
01:02:28.122 --> 01:02:30.122
And God guides every time again.

53
01:02:30.122 --> 01:02:33.122
The church of Jesus Christ is like a family.

54
01:02:33.122 --> 01:02:35.122
And a family also grows.

55
01:02:35.122 --> 01:02:39.122
And a family starts with you getting married and then the first child comes along.

56
01:02:39.122 --> 01:02:42.122
And then the children come along and a family grows.

57
01:02:42.122 --> 01:02:47.122
And then the Lord brings you from this house and maybe another house comes and this career.

58
01:02:47.122 --> 01:02:53.122
And when you walk with the Lord, it is a pleasant walk with God.

59
01:02:53.122 --> 01:02:59.122
I can testify to you like no one else that walking with the Lord is the very best there is.

60
01:03:00.122 --> 01:03:02.122
And so it is with this building.

61
01:03:02.122 --> 01:03:11.122
In 2023, it strongly came to my heart that God said it is time to start building.

62
01:03:11.122 --> 01:03:15.122
And as for 2023, we are already at the end of 2025.

63
01:03:15.122 --> 01:03:21.122
But in 2023, I felt strongly that it is now time to start building a new building.

64
01:03:21.122 --> 01:03:24.122
And with that, I went to the board and I said to the board.

65
01:03:24.122 --> 01:03:27.122
Board, it is time to start building a new building.

66
01:03:27.122 --> 01:03:29.122
It is now the time.

67
01:03:29.122 --> 01:03:33.122
Also in the board, there was enthusiasm through the Holy Spirit.

68
01:03:33.122 --> 01:03:37.122
And that is great because you immediately see confirmations in that.

69
01:03:37.122 --> 01:03:40.122
For that is how Jesus functions. He is the head of the body.

70
01:03:40.122 --> 01:03:44.122
And we are the body of Christ. We are his church.

71
01:03:44.122 --> 01:03:49.122
And then you come together as a board and you see that there is enthusiasm there.

72
01:03:49.122 --> 01:03:53.122
And that there is that joy of yes, it is time to start building.

73
01:03:53.122 --> 01:03:56.122
And 2023, follow the steps with me for a moment.

74
01:03:56.122 --> 01:04:01.122
2023 was, shall I say, the vision to start building a new building.

75
01:04:01.122 --> 01:04:03.122
Then you also go pray for it.

76
01:04:03.122 --> 01:04:07.122
Right? And then you also say in the prayer. Lord, here it comes.

77
01:04:07.122 --> 01:04:10.122
Then I will also show you an example shortly.

78
01:04:10.122 --> 01:04:13.122
For soon we will also pray together as a church community.

79
01:04:13.122 --> 01:04:17.122
When you are at a point, when you think to yourself.

80
01:04:17.122 --> 01:04:20.122
Is this God? And we all experience this as a church.

81
01:04:20.122 --> 01:04:23.122
Everyone in your individual lives.

82
01:04:23.122 --> 01:04:28.122
You will experience things that make you say. Is this you, Lord?

83
01:04:28.122 --> 01:04:33.122
Or is this my own ambition? Is this you, Lord?

84
01:04:33.122 --> 01:04:35.122
Or are these my own thoughts?

85
01:04:35.122 --> 01:04:39.122
It's a very normal question that all people go through at some point.

86
01:04:39.122 --> 01:04:46.122
And what you do then is you always go in prayer to God the Father.

87
01:04:46.122 --> 01:04:50.122
And then you simply say what you want to know.

88
01:04:50.122 --> 01:04:54.122
Be clear and honest towards God.

89
01:04:54.122 --> 01:04:59.122
For God is not vague either. God is also clear and very honest.

90
01:04:59.122 --> 01:05:04.122
And so we prayed. We went to God in prayer.

91
01:05:04.122 --> 01:05:08.122
And we said, Lord, if it is your will that we are going to build a new building.

92
01:05:08.122 --> 01:05:12.122
Then open the doors for us and give the green light.

93
01:05:12.122 --> 01:05:17.122
So that we know it is your voice that we are going to build.

94
01:05:18.122 --> 01:05:22.122
Give confirmations. Give open doors.

95
01:05:22.122 --> 01:05:27.122
I am a big fan of the concept of praying for open doors.

96
01:05:27.122 --> 01:05:32.122
I am also a big fan of asking for green lights, asking for confirmations.

97
01:05:32.122 --> 01:05:36.122
And Jesus says my sheep recognize my voice.

98
01:05:36.122 --> 01:05:39.122
So you also recognize it when he gives confirmations.

99
01:05:39.122 --> 01:05:42.122
Believe me, maybe you are still young in Christ.

100
01:05:42.122 --> 01:05:46.122
And you think to yourself, how then? How does God confirm?

101
01:05:46.122 --> 01:05:48.122
How does he speak? You'll find out.

102
01:05:48.122 --> 01:05:51.122
For God knows how to find you. Believe me.

103
01:05:51.122 --> 01:05:53.122
If you love him, he knows how to find you.

104
01:05:53.122 --> 01:05:56.122
And he knows how to get attention because he is awesome. Amen.

105
01:05:56.122 --> 01:05:59.122
And we pray Lord, are you this?

106
01:05:59.122 --> 01:06:08.122
And within a short time, we were offered two pieces of land by our neighbors.

107
01:06:08.122 --> 01:06:13.122
And in the world of real estate, there is a saying.

108
01:06:13.122 --> 01:06:20.122
If you are offered a piece of land by your neighbor once in your life.

109
01:06:20.122 --> 01:06:23.122
Then you must do it because it never happens again.

110
01:06:23.122 --> 01:06:25.122
That is a saying in the real estate world.

111
01:06:25.122 --> 01:06:30.122
If you are offered a piece of land by your neighbors once in your life.

112
01:06:30.122 --> 01:06:32.122
You must do it because that never happens.

113
01:06:32.122 --> 01:06:38.122
Within one week, we were offered not one piece of land by our neighbors.

114
01:06:38.122 --> 01:06:42.122
But we were offered that piece of land by our neighbors.

115
01:06:42.122 --> 01:06:50.122
And that piece of land was also offered in the same week by separate owners who knew nothing of each other.

116
01:06:50.122 --> 01:06:53.122
I'm not exaggerating. I know I'm an exaggerator.

117
01:06:53.122 --> 01:06:56.122
But that's why I'm bringing Bram in.

118
01:06:56.122 --> 01:06:59.122
He can fact-check me.

119
01:06:59.122 --> 01:07:01.122
Is it true or not?

120
01:07:01.122 --> 01:07:05.122
I'll say it even stronger.

121
01:07:06.122 --> 01:07:14.122
During a building committee meeting, we were first grateful for that piece of land.

122
01:07:14.122 --> 01:07:22.122
And in our conversation about what we are all going to build, we said to each other as a fantasy.

123
01:07:22.122 --> 01:07:26.122
It would also be great to get that southern piece.

124
01:07:26.122 --> 01:07:29.122
But whose is that?

125
01:07:29.122 --> 01:07:30.122
Do you know?

126
01:07:30.122 --> 01:07:32.122
And is it for sale?

127
01:07:32.122 --> 01:07:34.122
And whose is that? Yes, I don't know.

128
01:07:34.122 --> 01:07:35.122
Move on, next.

129
01:07:35.122 --> 01:07:37.122
So very fleeting.

130
01:07:37.122 --> 01:07:39.122
And after that meeting, we walk outside.

131
01:07:39.122 --> 01:07:41.122
We get into our cars.

132
01:07:41.122 --> 01:07:42.122
Roland is my witness.

133
01:07:42.122 --> 01:07:43.122
He was there.

134
01:07:43.122 --> 01:07:44.122
It's raining.

135
01:07:44.122 --> 01:07:46.122
There is no reason to just get out.

136
01:07:46.122 --> 01:07:48.122
The weather wasn't nice.

137
01:07:48.122 --> 01:07:49.122
Believe me.

138
01:07:49.122 --> 01:07:50.122
We drive in the dark.

139
01:07:50.122 --> 01:07:52.122
We drive here, over there.

140
01:07:52.122 --> 01:07:54.122
And suddenly Roland slams on the brakes.

141
01:07:54.122 --> 01:07:56.122
And he says, what is that over there?

142
01:07:56.122 --> 01:07:58.122
And he points that way.

143
01:07:58.122 --> 01:08:00.122
So behind this building he points that way.

144
01:08:00.122 --> 01:08:02.122
He says, what is that over there?

145
01:08:02.122 --> 01:08:04.122
And there was, check this.

146
01:08:04.122 --> 01:08:07.122
There was a real estate sign.

147
01:08:07.122 --> 01:08:10.122
On our property.

148
01:08:10.122 --> 01:08:13.122
Regarding someone else's land.

149
01:08:13.122 --> 01:08:15.122
Makes no sense.

150
01:08:15.122 --> 01:08:17.122
Let me explain.

151
01:08:17.122 --> 01:08:19.122
That doesn't make sense.

152
01:08:19.122 --> 01:08:21.122
If you ever sell your house.

153
01:08:21.122 --> 01:08:27.122
You wouldn't put the realtor's sign in the neighbors' yard.

154
01:08:27.122 --> 01:08:29.122
You wouldn't do that.

155
01:08:29.122 --> 01:08:31.122
That's not even allowed.

156
01:08:31.122 --> 01:08:33.122
Seems to me.

157
01:08:33.122 --> 01:08:35.122
Sander den Daags.

158
01:08:35.122 --> 01:08:37.122
Next day.

159
01:08:37.122 --> 01:08:39.122
The next day.

160
01:08:39.122 --> 01:08:41.122
8:58.

161
01:08:41.122 --> 01:08:43.122
Is little Timmetje on the phone without patience.

162
01:08:43.122 --> 01:08:45.122
And I call the real estate office.

163
01:08:45.122 --> 01:08:47.122
And I say.

164
01:08:47.122 --> 01:08:49.122
Why is there a sign hanging.

165
01:08:49.122 --> 01:08:51.122
On our property.

166
01:08:51.122 --> 01:08:53.122
Regarding another property for sale.

167
01:08:53.122 --> 01:08:55.122
Oh, sorry.

168
01:08:55.122 --> 01:08:57.122
We shouldn't have done that.

169
01:08:57.122 --> 01:08:59.122
We will take it down immediately.

170
01:08:59.122 --> 01:09:01.122
We apologize.

171
01:09:01.122 --> 01:09:03.122
Sorry for bothering you.

172
01:09:03.122 --> 01:09:05.122
I say just take that sign away.

173
01:09:05.122 --> 01:09:07.122
Because it is sold.

174
01:09:07.122 --> 01:09:09.122
Amen.

175
01:09:09.122 --> 01:09:11.122
And that is cool.

176
01:09:11.122 --> 01:09:13.122
That is just a cool story.

177
01:09:13.122 --> 01:09:15.122
Listen.

178
01:09:15.122 --> 01:09:17.122
Architect.

179
01:09:17.122 --> 01:09:19.122
Notary.

180
01:09:19.122 --> 01:09:21.122
People who know about that.

181
01:09:21.122 --> 01:09:23.122
Everyone understands.

182
01:09:23.122 --> 01:09:25.122
Within 1 week.

183
01:09:25.122 --> 01:09:27.122
That is a miracle.

184
01:09:27.122 --> 01:09:29.122
Just a miracle.

185
01:09:29.122 --> 01:09:31.122
And this is how you must recognize God.

186
01:09:31.122 --> 01:09:33.122
In all your ways.

187
01:09:33.122 --> 01:09:35.122
So you say Lord.

188
01:09:35.122 --> 01:09:37.122
Are you this?

189
01:09:37.122 --> 01:09:39.122
Will you then open doors?

190
01:09:39.122 --> 01:09:41.122
And then you pray that.

191
01:09:41.122 --> 01:09:43.122
And if you then receive such confirmations within 1 week.

192
01:09:43.122 --> 01:09:45.122
Then you can say very solidly.

193
01:09:45.122 --> 01:09:47.122
The Lord wants it.

194
01:09:47.122 --> 01:09:49.122
And we see that the Lord wants it.

195
01:09:49.122 --> 01:09:51.122
We see it, don't we?

196
01:09:51.122 --> 01:09:53.122
You can recognize a tree by its fruits.

197
01:09:53.122 --> 01:09:55.122
There is growth and growth means more.

198
01:09:55.122 --> 01:09:57.122
And so we can see it.

199
01:09:57.122 --> 01:09:59.122
God is adding.

200
01:09:59.122 --> 01:10:01.122
People are coming to repentance.

201
01:10:01.122 --> 01:10:03.122
We may baptize people in the name of Jesus.

202
01:10:03.122 --> 01:10:05.122
We may disciple people through the Word.

203
01:10:05.122 --> 01:10:07.122
There is growth. There is health.

204
01:10:07.122 --> 01:10:09.122
Things are going well with the open church.

205
01:10:09.122 --> 01:10:11.122
All glory to King Jesus.

206
01:10:11.122 --> 01:10:13.122
All glory to King Jesus.

207
01:10:13.122 --> 01:10:15.122
2023 was a year of vision and prayer.

208
01:10:15.122 --> 01:10:17.122
2024.

209
01:10:17.122 --> 01:10:19.122
The year after that.

210
01:10:19.122 --> 01:10:21.122
Was then the permit year.

211
01:10:21.122 --> 01:10:23.122
Then you have to knock on the door of the government.

212
01:10:23.122 --> 01:10:25.122
In Lommel.

213
01:10:25.122 --> 01:10:27.122
And you will collaborate with the architect.

214
01:10:27.122 --> 01:10:29.122
And you will tell the architect.

215
01:10:29.122 --> 01:10:31.122
Okay, this is how we want to draw.

216
01:10:31.122 --> 01:10:33.122
And this is what we need and that is what we need.

217
01:10:33.122 --> 01:10:35.122
And then the architect will go.

218
01:10:35.122 --> 01:10:37.122
He will then apply for the permits in Lommel.

219
01:10:37.122 --> 01:10:39.122
That was the next miracle.

220
01:10:39.122 --> 01:10:41.122
2024.

221
01:10:41.122 --> 01:10:43.122
In July.

222
01:10:43.122 --> 01:10:45.122
We have submitted our permits.

223
01:10:45.122 --> 01:10:47.122
To the city of Lommel.

224
01:10:47.122 --> 01:10:49.122
And all the people in Lommel.

225
01:10:49.122 --> 01:10:51.122
Lommel architects.

226
01:10:51.122 --> 01:10:53.122
And people who have something to do with the government of Lommel.

227
01:10:53.122 --> 01:10:55.122
All the people are complaining.

228
01:10:55.122 --> 01:10:57.122
In this area.

229
01:10:57.122 --> 01:10:59.122
That nothing, nothing, nothing, nothing is possible.

230
01:10:59.122 --> 01:11:01.122
In Lommel.

231
01:11:01.122 --> 01:11:03.122
They are stricter.

232
01:11:03.122 --> 01:11:05.122
Standards.

233
01:11:05.122 --> 01:11:07.122
Environmental standards.

234
01:11:07.122 --> 01:11:09.122
Dimensions.

235
01:11:09.122 --> 01:11:11.122
That fence has to be like this. That roof cannot be like that.

236
01:11:11.122 --> 01:11:13.122
A dormer cannot be like this.

237
01:11:13.122 --> 01:11:15.122
It is becoming super strict.

238
01:11:15.122 --> 01:11:17.122
And all the people who are building.

239
01:11:17.122 --> 01:11:19.122
And.

240
01:11:19.122 --> 01:11:21.122
So.

241
01:11:21.122 --> 01:11:23.122
When we submitted our permit application.

242
01:11:23.122 --> 01:11:25.122
The architect said.

243
01:11:25.122 --> 01:11:27.122
Such a permit application takes.

244
01:11:27.122 --> 01:11:29.122
At least.

245
01:11:29.122 --> 01:11:31.122
Six months.

246
01:11:31.122 --> 01:11:33.122
At least six months.

247
01:11:33.122 --> 01:11:35.122
But.

248
01:11:35.122 --> 01:11:37.122
If something is found.

249
01:11:37.122 --> 01:11:39.122
In the ground.

250
01:11:39.122 --> 01:11:41.122
Or they think there might be even a little bone or a shard from the past.

251
01:11:41.122 --> 01:11:43.122
In the ground.

252
01:11:43.122 --> 01:11:45.122
